{"passive":{"name":"Cell Division","description":"Each time Zac hits an enemy with an ability, he sheds a chunk of himself that can be reabsorbed to restore Health. Upon taking fatal damage, Zac splits into 4 bloblets that attempt to recombine. If any bloblets remain, he will revive with an amount of Health depending on the Health of the surviving bloblets. Each bloblet has a percentage of Zac's maximum Health, Armor and Magic Resistance. This ability has a 5 minute cooldown."},"primaryAbilities":[{"slot":"Q","name":"Stretching Strikes","enginePath":"Characters/Zac/Spells/ZacQAbility/ZacQ","maxRank":5,"description":"Zac stretches an arm, grabbing an enemy. Attacking a different enemy will cause him to throw both targets towards each other.","tooltipTemplate":"Zac stretches his arm out, attaching it to the first enemy hit to deal <magicDamage>{{ totaldamage }} magic damage</magicDamage> and briefly <status>Slow</status> them. Zac's next Attack gains increased range and applies the same damage and <status>Slow</status>. <br /><br />If Zac hits a <i>different</i> enemy with this Attack, he <status>Knocks Up</status> both towards each other. If they collide, they and surrounding enemies take <magicDamage>{{ totaldamage }} magic damage</magicDamage> and are briefly <status>Slowed</status>.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[14,12.5,11,9.5,8],"costByRank":[0,0,0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[800,800,800,800,800],"resourceTemplate":"{{ hpcost*100 }}% of current Health ({{ healthcosttooltip }})"},{"slot":"W","name":"Unstable Matter","enginePath":"Characters/Zac/Spells/ZacWAbility/ZacW","maxRank":5,"description":"Zac explodes outward towards nearby enemies, dealing a percentage of their maximum health as magic damage.","tooltipTemplate":"Zac's body erupts, dealing <magicDamage>{{ basedamage }} + {{ displaypercentdamage }} max Health magic damage</magicDamage> to nearby enemies.<br /><br />Absorbing <keywordMajor>Goo</keywordMajor> reduces this Ability's Cooldown by 1 second.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[5,5,5,5,5],"costByRank":[0,0,0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[350,350,350,350,350],"resourceTemplate":"{{ hpcost*100 }}% of current Health ({{ tooltiphealthcost }})"},{"slot":"E","name":"Elastic Slingshot","enginePath":"Characters/Zac/Spells/ZacEAbility/ZacE","maxRank":5,"description":"Zac attaches his arms to the ground and stretches back, launching himself forward.","tooltipTemplate":"<charge>Begin Charging:</charge> Zac pulls himself taut, charging up a dash over {{ channeltime }} seconds.<br /><br /><release>Release:</release> Zac launches himself and <status>Knocks Up</status> enemies where he lands for up to {{ maxstun }} second (based on charge time), dealing them <magicDamage>{{ damage }} magic damage</magicDamage>. Zac spawns an extra chunk of <keywordMajor>Goo</keywordMajor> for each enemy champion hit.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[21,18,15,12,9],"costByRank":[0,0,0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[300,300,300,300,300],"resourceTemplate":"{{ hpcost*100 }}% of current Health ({{ healthcosttooltip }})"},{"slot":"R","name":"Let's Bounce!","enginePath":"Characters/Zac/Spells/ZacRAbility/ZacR","maxRank":3,"description":"Zac bounces four times, knocking up enemies hit and slowing them.","tooltipTemplate":"Zac bounces {{ bounces }} times. The first bounce to hit each enemy <status>Knocks</status> them back and deals <magicDamage>{{ damageperbounce }} magic damage</magicDamage>. Subsequent bounces deal <magicDamage>{{ damagepersubsequentbounce }} magic damage</magicDamage> and <status>Slow</status> by {{ slowamount*100 }}% for {{ slowduration }} second.<br /><br />Zac gains up to <speed>{{ endingms*100 }}% Move Speed</speed> over time and can cast <spellName>Unstable Matter</spellName> while bouncing.{{ spellmodifierdescriptionappend }}","cooldownByRank":[120,105,90],"costByRank":[0,0,0],"rangeByRank":[300,300,300],"resourceTemplate":"No Cost"}],"allSpellRecords":[{"path":"Characters/Zac/Spells/Za